    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to kitesurf in 2 dimensions.  Compete in competitions, travel to new lands, race for the finish line, or just land some tricks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to kite.  Tutorial covers controls for basic riding, loading and popping, jumping, rails, back rolls, board offs, and kite loops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kiteboarding is a dangerous sport!\u00a0 Watch out for jellyfish, drones, sharks, rockets, and crash landings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through amateur, minor league, semi pro, pro, and heracles worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel in traditional platformer levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it to the end but watch out for sharks, jellyfish, and drones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins on the way.\u00a0 Use them at the shop to customize your look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in competitions.\u00a0 Bring home a bronze, silver or gold medal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High score - high score wins - coins give bonus score points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best trick -\u00a0 best trick wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drone Madness - Hit as many drone grinds as you can, don't let the drones hit you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upside Down Grind Mode - Hit rails upside down to score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carrot Grab - Collect as many carrots as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race - Checkpoint race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trick Race - Checkpoint race.\u00a0 Landing tricks gives you bonus time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your characters outfit and kite gear at the store, be sure to collect plenty of coins in travel mode to use at the store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerups.  -Jump Higher, -Ride Faster, -Spin Faster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indie developed.\u00a0 My first major game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to kitesurf in 2 dimensions.  Compete in competitions, travel to new lands, race for the finish line, or just land some tricks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to kite.  Tutorial covers controls for basic riding, loading and popping, jumping, rails, back rolls, board offs, and kite loops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kiteboarding is a dangerous sport!\u00a0 Watch out for jellyfish, drones, sharks, rockets, and crash landings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through amateur, minor league, semi pro, pro, and heracles worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel in traditional platformer levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it to the end but watch out for sharks, jellyfish, and drones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins on the way.\u00a0 Use them at the shop to customize your look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in competitions.\u00a0 Bring home a bronze, silver or gold medal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High score - high score wins - coins give bonus score points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best trick -\u00a0 best trick wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drone Madness - Hit as many drone grinds as you can, don't let the drones hit you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upside Down Grind Mode - Hit rails upside down to score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carrot Grab - Collect as many carrots as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race - Checkpoint race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trick Race - Checkpoint race.\u00a0 Landing tricks gives you bonus time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your characters outfit and kite gear at the store, be sure to collect plenty of coins in travel mode to use at the store!</p><p class=\"bb_para